{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2021-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1636329600, "end_date": 1637020799, "month_true_total": 93, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:49:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "102829786", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011636613", "personaname": "A Bad Influence", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198011636613/", "num_games_owned": 373, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 6057, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 921, "last_played": 1785624792, "avatar": "4be8de9daa6406446ff0c83ea53724e135b97af7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I found this game a while ago and it was really interesting even though it wasn't in the state the devs wanted it to be.  A few months later and the game is developing and I've only seen major improvements.  The game has polish and many different ways of play, which is important for Rogue-lites.  Many little things to find and a difficulty curve that keeps it interesting.  \n\nI don't rate EA games on what they could be, but on what they are.  This game succeeds on both.  Can't wait to see the finished product and see the extra things the devs add.", "timestamp_created": 1636991576, "timestamp_updated": 1636991576, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102813645", "author": {"steamid": "76561198271922170", "personaname": "WetButter", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198271922170/", "num_games_owned": 315, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 6163, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 467, "last_played": 1766994437, "avatar": "ae18b3e12a7a7fad4b0247ec6796a1062b058263"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want an fps rouge like where gun go boom real good then play this game.", "timestamp_created": 1636963059, "timestamp_updated": 1636963059, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 11, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "102810937", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063490535", "personaname": "Orion Goetia", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063490535/", "num_games_owned": 407, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 3631, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1051, "last_played": 1761936463, "avatar": "d22d701c5226517a899a733fe12bd28ab0e01be7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Needs an endless mode but other than that this game is AMAZING! I can not wait to see the new content from future updates!!", "timestamp_created": 1636956497, "timestamp_updated": 1636956497, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "102806105", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145277239", "personaname": "cwr2390", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198145277239/", "num_games_owned": 77, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 12248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 6, "playtime_at_review": 622, "last_played": 1790446310, "avatar": "37cf1dc1f48ac849fb89a0b11182816609a9e6eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timestamp_created": 1636945945, "timestamp_updated": 1636945945, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102781101", "author": {"steamid": "76561198103100219", "personaname": "Enes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/enesenesenesenesenes/", "num_games_owned": 1038, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1637, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 259, "last_played": 1737232368, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very fun fast paced roguelite FPS, suprising amount of content at this moment and enjoyable gunplay!\n\nAnd with everyone comparing it to the elephant in the room (gunfire reborn), I will do the same. I have about 60 hours in the game. And yes its a bit comparable, but this game does alot of things better. Enemies are nicely varried. Bosses are fun and actively trying to kill you instead of slow woosh woosh woosh waves. \n\nIt does start out a bit slow but once you defeat the first boss in a run, the game shows its better sides. First bit is weakest atm for sure", "timestamp_created": 1636907974, "timestamp_updated": 1636998220, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.566326558589935303", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}